# Mechanical Pulse Lock

- **Typography:** Marvin Visions Bold = headings, data, questions, labels. Roboto Bold = body, one-word buttons, answer circles.
- **Radius:** 60px grid cards; 0px expanded Solo Focus. No box-shadow or text-shadow.
- **Color Therapy:** Grid = Primary (vibrant) hex; Solo Focus = Soft Cream bg, **Marvin = Primary color**, **circles = Dark Accent** + Soft Cream text. `lib/journeyColors.ts`: emotionColorMap, getJourneyColorHex (primary), getExpandedAccentHex (accent).
- **Copy:** Use **SAVE** (imperative), not "SAVINGS". Data stack: SAVE + CARBON. Written voice: **`zone-voice-copy.mdc`** + `lib/zone/zoneVoice.ts`.
- **Zone anchor:** Logo 51px + "HELLO {NAME}" Marvin H3 + Ask Zai 20px below. Floating Nav 40px visual. Bento: 13 blocks (1 Hero + 9 Journeys + 3 Tips), 60px radius. Card top-right: **arrow glyph only** (transparent, 2× H3).
- **Solo Focus:** Soft Cream; Marvin/body = **Primary**; **Close** = **40px** circle top-right (open-card arrow rotated 180°); Trinity + answer circles = **Dark Accent** + Soft Cream. 40px gap; Squish; Zip-Shut on answer.
- **Summary:** Soft Cream background; 40px logic gap; 80px Blue pill "ENTER THE KINETIC ZONE". Kinetic headline uses **word-by-word opacity ticker** on `/profile/summary` (not the intro glitch).
- **Settings:** Soft Cream; Marvin labels; RESET MACHINE 80px circle clears localStorage and redirects to /intro.
- **Zai:** 32px bubbles; user = Cool, Zai = Blue; 40px Floating Nav.
- **useCountUp:** Use for Hero and Summary slot-machine numbers. See `lib/utils/useCountUp.ts`.

Reference: `docs/HANDBOOK.md` (product + Zone/Solo Focus summary) and this rule file.
